Package: jmsequential
Type: Package
Title: Sequential Designs and Monitoring for Clinical Trials and Epidemiology
Version: 0.5.6
Authors@R: person("V.", "Moreno", email = "v.moreno@iconcologia.net", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Design and interim monitoring of studies analysed repeatedly as data
    accumulate, with control of type I and type II errors: group sequential
    boundaries (classical and error spending, with futility), Whitehead's
    triangular tests, sequential probability ratio tests, MaxSPRT safety
    surveillance, phase II multistage designs, and Bayesian and anytime-valid
    monitoring. Pure R numerical engine (recursive integration).
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: jmvcore (>= 2.4), R6, ggplot2
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
